msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:10
msgid "Manage projects and artifacts"
msgstr "管理项目和产物"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:13
msgid ""
"Keep controlled variants separate and persist only the runtime state "
"required for the next use of the experiment."
msgstr "将受控变体分开，并且只持久化下次使用实验所需的运行时状态。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:17
msgid "Projects and canvases"
msgstr "项目与画布"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:19
msgid ""
"A workspace contains projects, and each project owns one canvas. The "
"canvas stores a graph document and its viewport. Use a separate project "
"for a controlled variant instead of overwriting the only graph that "
"explains an earlier result."
msgstr "一个工作区包含项目，每个项目拥有一张画布。该画布存储图文档及其视口。对于受控变体，请使用单独的项目，而不要覆盖唯一能解释早期结果的图。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:24
msgid ""
"Saved Templates open as working copies in new projects. The library entry"
" remains separate from later edits on the canvas."
msgstr "已保存的 Template 会在新项目中以工作副本打开。库条目仍与之后在画布上的编辑分离。"

