#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:72
msgid ""
"Prefer Small for committed Templates. Medium and Large JSON can contain "
"experiment results or encoded model state, grow rapidly, and expose "
"information that does not belong in Git history. Inspect a saved file "
"before sharing it."
msgstr ""
"对于提交的 Template，优先使用 Small。Medium 和 Large JSON "
"可能包含实验结果或编码的模型状态，体积增长很快，并暴露不应进入 Git 历史的信息。共享前请检查已保存文件。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:77
msgid "Know what is local state"
msgstr "了解哪些内容属于本地状态"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:79
msgid ""
"The active workspace is persisted through `/api/workspace` to "
"`data/workspace.json`. Graph-library data is stored under "
"`data/graph_library/`; committed canonical templates live in "
"`data/graph_library/templates/`."
msgstr ""
"活动工作区通过 `/api/workspace` 持久化到 `data/workspace.json`。图库数据存储在 "
"`data/graph_library/` 下；提交的规范 template 位于 "
"`data/graph_library/templates/`。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:84
msgid ""
"The repository ignores most local workspace, library, credential, and "
"runtime artifact state, but ignore rules are not a data-handling policy. "
"Check the actual file and Git status before committing or sending an "
"archive."
msgstr "仓库会忽略大多数本地工作区、库、凭据和运行时产物状态，但忽略规则不是数据处理策略。提交或发送归档前，请检查实际文件和 Git 状态。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/projects-and-artifacts.md:88
msgid ""
"Use [Make a result reproducible](reproducibility.md) to decide what "
"context a shared artifact still needs outside its JSON."
msgstr "使用[使结果可复现](reproducibility.md)来决定共享产物在其 JSON 之外仍需要哪些上下文。"
